            "en": "The one-dimensional conservative form. Consult each test for its equation of state, initial data and boundaries. Planar(d=1) and cylindrical-radial(d=2) ideal-gas Euler Noh inflow, with geometric source, cold outer boundary, reflecting origin and exactly p0=0 as specified in the example."
