        {
          "id": "formulation-noh-shock",
          "name": {
            "ja": "この実行例の式と条件",
            "en": "This execution’s formulation and conditions"
          },
          "url": {
            "ja": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/validation/noh-shock/?lang=ja#noh-shock-ja-algorithm",
            "en": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/validation/noh-shock/?lang=en#noh-shock-en-algorithm"
          },
          "note": {
            "ja": "区分定数再構築のlocal Lax–Friedrichs/Rusanov流束とSSPRK2（Heun）。幾何CFLはV/(A_L a_L+A_R a_R)に基づきます。運動量の幾何源は面の数値法線応力P*=F_mom−((u_L+u_R)/2)F_massを左右平均しΔAで積分する独自の整合的一次求積です。静止定圧では厳密相殺、d=1では源がゼロ。反射面の数値応力を原点セルへ伝え、cold流の特異な蓄積を避けます。保存量・圧力のfloor、クリッピング、厳密解への置換はありません。丸め誤差内の負内部エネルギーは記録し、音速の平方根引数だけゼロを使います。",
            "en": "Piecewise-constant local Lax–Friedrichs/Rusanov flux and SSPRK2 (Heun), with a geometric CFL based on V/(A_L a_L+A_R a_R). The radial-momentum source uses an original consistent first-order quadrature: average the two interfacial numerical normal stresses P*=F_mom−((u_L+u_R)/2)F_mass and multiply by delta A. This exactly balances static constant pressure and vanishes for d=1. Reflection stress reaches the origin cell rather than allowing singular cold accumulation. No state/pressure floor, clipping or substitution of analytic solution arrays. Negative internal energy within roundoff is logged; only the sound-speed square-root argument uses zero at roundoff."
          },
          "role": "example-definition"
        },
