            "en": "Inputs, acceptance criteria and hashes were saved before the first run. The initial cell-pressure p_i delta A source passed planar checks but failed cylindrical shock formation; its source and full refinement results are retained. The interface-stress revision is tested against the SAME thresholds. Analytic conservative cell means split shock-crossing integrals, storing p(mean U) separately from the physical mean pressure. Pinned independent LANL ExactPack was separately executed for points and split-quadrature means. Checks include full-domain volume-weighted relative L1/L2/Linf, explicit center/shock/plateau masks, pressure half-height shock location, initial density amplification 4^d (shock jump 4), and stage-weighted SSPRK2 boundary-inflow budgets."
